  "slug": "godot-lsp-bridge",
  "name": "Godot Lsp Bridge",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "GDScript language intelligence for Godot 4.x — autocompletion, go-to-definition, hover docs, diagnostics, and scene/resource file support via Godot’s native LSP.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install godot-lsp-bridge@claude-community` from `Pixel-Directive-LLC/godot-lsp-bridge`.\n\nFull GDScript code intelligence — go-to-definition, hover docs, completions, diagnostics, and GDShader validation — inside Claude Code, powered by Godot's native Language Server.",
